      <EnglishText>Ethos</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44676,45100,45456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44824,44976,45260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アルベルト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Albert</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44480</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_036_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それにしても、さっきはびっくりしたね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that was
a shock, huh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44572</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_036_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まさか、あのダオスが出てくるなんて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can't believe it... Was
that really *the* Dhaos...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44680</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_036_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんだってんだよ、まったく。
オレら襲ってどうすんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What the hell even was all that? Like,
c'mon, what was he attacking *us* for?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44828</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_036_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>んだんだ！　突然現われて、突然襲ってくるなんて、
穏やかじゃねぇだーよ。ただの、卑怯もんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll say! Appearin' and attackin' outta nowhere...
Unreasonable, ain't it? He's a coward, nothin' but.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44980</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_036_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もし、大怪我でもしたら、おら絶対に許さなかったど！
金髪チャラチャラ、クールにすかしよってからに</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If he'd hurt ya, I'd never let 'im get away with it! And
tryin' to act all cool, with that flashy gold hair of his.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45104</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_036_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ、珍しくオレらの心配してくれてんのか。
たまにはいいとこあんな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, what, you're actually worrying for us
for once? I guess you do have a good side.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45264</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_036_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何言ってるだ？　おらが心配なのは&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;だけだど。
チビ助やエト助がどうなろうと、おらの知ったことか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What're ya talkin' about? I'm worried for &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;'s sake.
I couldn't care less about you or Ethos, ya pipsqueak.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45336</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_036_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何期待してたの……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What were
you expecting...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45460</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_036_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>別にあんなヤツなんかに期待してねー……
期待なんてしてねーからな……っ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't expect anything from that freak... No,
seriously. I didn't expect any better. I mean it...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Notice</Section>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
